# grade: Π, rejecting: a finding refutes translatability by Table 7's rows; silence affirms nothing.
# Rule 1: a function argument is a const value with a const call operator.
# A static operator() has no object and is exempt; so are lambdas.
match cxxMethodDecl(isExpansionInMainFile(), hasOverloadedOperatorName("()"), unless(anyOf(isConst(), isStaticStorageClass(), ofClass(cxxRecordDecl(isLambda())))), hasAncestor(scope))
